                "loc": "JER.48.1+JER.48.2+JER.48.3+JER.48.4+JER.48.5+JER.48.6+JER.48.7+JER.48.8+JER.48.9+JER.48.10+JER.48.11+JER.48.12+JER.48.13+JER.48.14+JER.48.15+JER.48.16+JER.48.17+JER.48.18+JER.48.19+JER.48.20+JER.48.21+JER.48.22+JER.48.23+JER.48.24+JER.48.25+JER.48.26+JER.48.27+JER.48.28+JER.48.29+JER.48.30+JER.48.31+JER.48.32+JER.48.33+JER.48.34+JER.48.35+JER.48.36+JER.48.37+JER.48.38+JER.48.39+JER.48.40+JER.48.41+JER.48.42+JER.48.43+JER.48.44+JER.48.45+JER.48.46+JER.48.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 48:1-47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbūri yo kuri Mowabu: kuko mw ijoro rimwe ahitwa Ari‐Mowabu hageseye, hakomvomvowe; kuko mw ijoro rimwe ahitwa Kiri‐Mowabu hageseye, hakomvomvowe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukobga w’i Diboni aradūze, aja mu bitabo kuririrayo; Abanyamowabu bariko baraborogera i Nebo n’i Medeba: imitwe yabo yose imowe inkomvorera, bo n’ubganwa bgose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagenda mu nzira zabo bacoceye amagunira; hejuru ku nzu zabo no ku nama umuntu wese araboroga, yiyuha iryosozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I Heshiboni harataka bo n’i Eleyale; mber’ amajwi yabo ashika n’i Yahazi; ni co gituma ingabo z’i Mowabu ziboroga, imitima yabo ikaja mu gatengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutima wanje uririra Mowabu; impunzi zaho zahungiye i Sowari n’i Egilati‐shelishiya; ahadūga haja i Luhiti ni ho badūga barira ingenda; no mu nzira ija i Horonayimu ni ho batakira ugutaka kw’ubgihebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw amazi y’i Nimurimu azokama, ubgatsi bgaho buzokwuma, ubgatsi butotahaye bubure, ntihazomera ikintu na kimwe kibisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co kizotuma ibintu bari barīronkeye n’ ivyo bari barabītse babijana ku mugezi w’ibiti vyitwa arabimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ugutaka gukikije ku mbibe z’i Mowabu, amaborogo yaho agashika muri Egulayimu, mber’ ayo maborogo agashika n’i Beri‐elimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw amazi y’i Dimoni yuzuye ibitenga vy’amaraso; kandi nzokwongera guteza i Dimoni ibindi vyago, abacitse b’i Mowabu n’amasigarira y’ico gihugu nzobatēza intambge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
